-- הסכם קיבוצי מיום 26.6.2014 — תיקונים והתאמות בהסכם עוז לתמורה בעקבות
-- הרפורמה בבחינות הבגרות: the Centre of Local Government and the three
-- large cities and ארגון המורים amend the Oz LaTmura agreement of 14.8.2011
-- (sectioned, one module per article: l4/agreements/oz-latmura/2011-08-14_oz-latmura_founding-agreement/)
-- and the follow-up committee's decision of 28.5.2013
-- (2013-05-28_oz-latmura_vaadat-higui-decision), after the Ministry's
-- reform of the matriculation exams ("למידה משמעותית"). Signed by the
-- employers on 15.7.2014 and approved by the wages commissioner under §29(א)
-- of the Budget Foundations Law on 23.7.2014. Its own period runs to
-- 31.8.2017 (§2), and the parties gave notice under §13 of the Collective
-- Agreements Law that §§8 and 11 end then; the agreement of 14.3.2018 (§23)
-- kept them in force.
--
-- WHAT IT CHANGES IS ENCODED HERE, DATED; WHAT IT LEAVES IS IMPORTED. The
-- reform's gradual years run to תשע"ז instead of תשע"ד (§§4–7: the Oz
-- agreement's §§5, 7 and 8, the decision's §18); §9 and §22, the teacher's
-- and the principal's work week, are replaced (§8); the evaluation grant of
-- §35 ends from תשע"ד and a grant of 666 is paid for תשע"ג (§9); the Oz
-- LaTmura supplement for principals ends from תשע"ד and the transition
-- supplement enters the management allowance's base (§10); the bagrut
-- preparation allowance is split 70/30 between the external exam and the
-- school's assessment (§11). Each changed rule reads the Oz module it
-- changes and says what moved. It speaks to no pay item of
-- l4/lib/vocabulary.l4 and is in no root.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `oz-founding-5`
IMPORT `oz-founding-8`
IMPORT `oz-founding-9`
IMPORT `oz-founding-22`
IMPORT `oz-founding-24`
IMPORT `oz-founding-35`
IMPORT `2013-05-28_oz-latmura_vaadat-higui-decision`
IMPORT hours_of_work_law

-- not weighed against `the Equal Pay Law`: the reduction §8(ד)'s new §22(ו)
-- gives a principal who is the mother of a child under 14 is a benefit in
-- connection with parenthood, which the law's §13 leaves out; it is the Oz
-- agreement's §22(ו), weighed there (convention instruments.equal-pay-teaching).

-- not weighed against `the Equal Opportunities Law`: §8(ד)'s new §22(ו)
-- repeats the Oz agreement's 2.4 management hours for a principal who is a
-- mother teacher, word for word; the mother teacher and the fathers it
-- leaves out are weighed where the earlier agreements define her, on the
-- card mother-position-fathers (F-ofek-hadash-base-7-c, F-1.13-e).

-- not weighed against `the Women's Work Law`: §9(ד) and (ז) name unpaid
-- leave and a sabbatical among the absences that cut or bar the grant of
-- 666; maternity leave is not named, and the grant is the Oz agreement's
-- §35(ו) shape, whose module weighs nothing the law puts a floor under.

-- not weighed against `the Advance Notice Law`: §11(ב) only says the
-- organisation's acceptance of the bagrut reform is no consent to
-- dismissing teachers, and the evaluation model names ending employment
-- among the decisions evaluation serves; neither gives or asks notice, so
-- they rule nothing the law puts a floor under.

§ `הסכם קיבוצי — תיקונים בהסכם עוז לתמורה בעקבות הרפורמה בבחינות הבגרות (26.6.2014)`

DECLARE `26.6.2014 amendment action` IS ONE OF
    `draw up the year's lists of Oz reform schools for 5775 and 5776, consulting the organisation`
    `cooperate fully in carrying out the bagrut reform`
    `evaluate the teachers by the initial model`
    `pay the grant of 666 in the salary for August 2014`
    `agree a work plan of reduced and increased work`
    `sign consent to the work plan and the advance`
    `report the reform's school years to the organisation`

`why the documents it names are not here` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "סיכום הדיון מיום 5.2.2014 והנספח לו (הרפורמה בבחינות הבגרות); סיכום הדיון מיום 11.3.2014 ומודל ההערכה הראשוני; מכתב מנכ\"ל משרד החינוך מיום 14.8.2011 (סימוכין 15034909); מכתב הממונה על השכר מיום 2.3.2014"

