§§ `4 יישום רפורמת עוז לתמורה בבתי הספר`

-- akn:chp_2 The heading of part ב'.
-- akn:art_4 The heading of §4.

-- (א): §5(א) of the Oz agreement is replaced: the reform is applied
-- gradually over תשע"ב–תשע"ז; in each of תשע"ב–תשע"ד in some schools in
-- full and in others in part, by the Ministry's yearly lists made with the
-- organisation; from תשע"ה only in full, in every school where it is
-- applied; from תשע"ז in every school. (ב): a new §5(ג): in תשע"ה and
-- תשע"ו, the written consent of 60% of the school's teaching employees who
-- meet the reform's conditions (all but §7(ח)'s) is a threshold for
-- applying it there — or of a lower share, if the Ministry so sets. §5(ב),
-- 75% in תשע"ב–תשע"ד, is unchanged (oz-founding-5, imported).
@ref akn:art_4__para_a akn:art_4__para_b
GIVEN `the share the Ministry set` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      staff IS A LIST OF `member of the school's teaching staff under section 5`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the school meets the new §5(ג)'s consent threshold` `the share the Ministry set` staff IF
    count consenting AT LEAST threshold TIMES count eligible
    WHERE
        eligible MEANS filter (GIVEN m YIELD NOT `section 7(ח) keeps the existing teaching employee off the reform` (m's `qualifications`)) staff
        consenting MEANS filter (GIVEN m YIELD m's `consented in writing to the reform`) eligible
        threshold MEANS
            CONSIDER `the share the Ministry set`
            WHEN JUST s THEN min s (60%)
            WHEN NOTHING THEN 60%

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
      `the year's list` IS A `extent of the Oz reform`
      `the share the Ministry set` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      staff IS A LIST OF `member of the school's teaching staff under section 5`
