    BRANCH
        IF y AT LEAST `the school year 5777 of the 2014 amendment` THEN `the Oz reform in full`
        IF y AT LEAST `the school year 5775`
        THEN IF     NOT `the year's list` EQUALS `off the Oz reform`
                AND `the school meets the new §5(ג)'s consent threshold` `the share the Ministry set` staff
             THEN `the Oz reform in full`
             ELSE `off the Oz reform`
        OTHERWISE `how far the reform is applied in the school in` y `the year's list` staff

