§§ `7 תיקון החלטת ועדת המעקב`

-- akn:art_7 The heading of §7.

-- In §18 of the decision of 28.5.2013, every "the school year תשע"ה"
-- becomes "תשע"ז": the teachers of grades 13–14 join the reform only in
-- תשע"ז, and until then a teacher who teaches both them and lower grades
-- is on the reform's terms for his position in grade 12 and below. §18(ב),
-- which counts his grades 13–14 hours toward the thresholds, is unchanged.
